  {
   "id": "d2",
   "narration": {
    "en": "Mahatma Gandhi returned from South Africa in 1915 and led satyagraha in Champaran, Kheda and Ahmedabad. In 1919 he called a nationwide satyagraha against the Rowlatt Act."
   },
